<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Purview portal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The single admin UI across all Purview solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;DLP / Labels / IRM / Audit / eDiscovery / DSPM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The M365-tenant compliance solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;Unified audit log&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;System of record for all activity, incl. Copilot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Purview account (Data Map)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Azure resource behind cataloging and scanning.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Key Vault / Managed VNet IR&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scan secrets and private-endpoint scanning.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;AWS IR + S3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cross-cloud scanning; not supported in Azure Gov.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;Self-hosted IR / scanner / file shares&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The only components customers actually run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;Onboarded devices&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Endpoint DLP and the browser extension.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="150" width="320" height="620" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
